WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:07.178
A raaga ne-a. Saam-bi-rãmbã la Mossi rãmbã lagem-n-taar.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.880
Sã n yaa ne Samõ wã, vɩɩmã yɩɩ wa b sẽn da ratã hal tɩ ta rũndã.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:33.856
Neb nins sẽn zʋʋgd malɛgsã ra gũuda ne bugum sawadga.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:35.776
Yaa tõnd n so tẽngã.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:45.322
A Samo taoor soab pa leok ye. A boola a tãb-biisi.

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:07.538
La zabr sɩngame. Sagls nins sẽn zabd ne wed-rãmbã.

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:20.464
Tõnd zabame daar fãa, la ned baa a yen ka tõog ye.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:32.032
Zĩ-kãnga ra lebga yʋngo.

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:47.720
Neb nins b sẽn da yã wã ra yaa nin-buiid bal n kell n zĩnd be.

00:01:56.000 --> 00:02:02.106
Neb a yiib n gesa taaba. Rẽ poore, ned a yembr kõ-a-la a to wã.

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:21.696
Saam-bi-poak a ye n wa, t'a tɩ yals moosã soabg taoore.

00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:38.546
A yɛɛsame, la a wa n gesa biigã. Ned a ye sẽn da lʋɩt so-kãsengã zug n na n zab ne Samõ tãb-biisi.

00:02:42.000 --> 00:02:44.576
Ned pa leb n tẽr a taabã logtoogã ye.

00:02:57.500 --> 00:02:59.724
Yaa zɩɩm wʋsg n pa tõe n maan bũmb ye.

00:03:00.500 --> 00:03:03.524
Tõnd sʋka, zɩɩm kõn le zĩnd ye.

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:10.272
La bãmb ned kam fãa ra yũuda koom-koglg a yembre.

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:20.570
La b yõka taab ne taab. La laafɩ wã ra pa le be ye.

00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:34.696
Yãmb Mossi wã rɩta wʋsgo!

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:41.360
Sã n yaa ne yãmba, Samo rãmbã gomda wʋsgo.

00:03:44.000 --> 00:03:53.610
Sẽn sɩng ne wakat kãnga, b yaalda taaba, la ned ka yikd sũ-yikri ye. Yaa a Zeova n yeel-a woto.

00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:15.808
Rũndã-rũndã me, d sã n gomd zak rãmb yelle, d tõe n yeelame tɩ zabr pa na n le zĩnd ye.
